 "version": "1.0",
 "title": "Custom splash",
 "description": "Draws your own 128x64 image as the Digitone boot splash. Replace splash.bin with mksplash.py; the mod copies it over each composed intro frame and then runs the stock present. Works alongside any other mod and needs core.",
